config U30PRO_BSP
 bool "U30 Pro UMS9632 vendor BSP components"
 depends on ARCH_SPRD

if U30PRO_BSP
config F50PRO_NFC_GPIO
 tristate "F50 Pro NFC reset GPIO ownership"
 depends on OF_GPIO && GPIOLIB
 help
   Explicitly enabled only by the F50 Pro product; GPIO comes from its DT.

config F50PRO_LED_HANDOFF
 tristate "F50 Pro stock PMIC-to-GPIO indicator handoff"
 depends on MFD_SC27XX_PMIC && LEDS_CLASS
 help
   Build the MU3356-only opt-in white LED driver and boot handoff. It clears
   inherited PMIC red/green state and exposes their stock steady PWM. Loading
   without enabled=1 does not touch hardware; U30 Pro does not load it.

source "drivers/unisoc_platform/usb/musb/Kconfig"
source "drivers/unisoc_platform/usbpinmux/Kconfig"
config UNISOC_USB_HSPHY
 bool "UMS9632 USB2 high speed PHY"
 select USB_PHY
 depends on USB_GADGET
config U30PRO_KEXEC_BASE
 bool "U30 Pro kexec bootstrap with system sleep guarded"
 depends on KEXEC && SUSPEND
 help
   Enables the PM_SLEEP_SMP code needed for arm64 kexec while rejecting
   system sleep before device suspend. Type-C wake and cross-processor
   watchdog ownership during sleep remain unvalidated.

config U30PRO_CHARGER_LINK_DIAGNOSTIC
 bool "DIAGNOSTIC ONLY: bind master charger client without hardware operations"
 depends on I2C && U30PRO_KEXEC_BASE && !CHARGER_U30PRO_SGM41513
 help
   User-authorized test of dangling child-fwnode supplier ownership under
   strict fw_devlink. Does not access hardware or provide any regulator or
   charging function. Keep disabled for the base and final adaptation.

